# Unreal prototype (unreal/PryingEyes): only the source, config and Python scripts are tracked; everything the engine
# generates (and the imported assets, which the Python scripts in unreal/PryingEyes/Python rebuild from the Unity export) stays out of git.
unreal/**/Binaries/
unreal/**/Intermediate/
unreal/**/Saved/
unreal/**/DerivedDataCache/
unreal/**/Content/
unreal/**/.vs/
unreal/**/*.sln
unreal/**/*.suo
